This directory holds the storageState JSON files generated by tests/auth.setup.ts
(for example, playwright/.auth/user.json — see the "setup" project and the
"chromium-authenticated" project's storageState option in playwright.config.ts).

Do not commit real auth state here. Add "playwright/.auth/*.json" to .gitignore
and keep only this placeholder file under version control so the directory
exists before the setup project runs for the first time.
